re. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_diablo_rosso_iv_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_diablo_rosso_iv_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Hypersport Dot / Dot Tire / Sportbike Tire / Multi Compound Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CBR600RR / CBR1000RR, Yamaha YZF-R6 / YZF-R1 / MT-07 / MT-09, Kawasaki Ninja 650 / ZX-6R / ZX-10R, Suzuki GSX-R600 / GSX-R1000, BMW S1000RR, Ducati Monster / Panigale", "Tire Size": "110/70R17 54H; 110/70ZR17 54W; 120/60ZR17 55W; 120/70ZR17 58W; 140/70R17 66H; 150/60R17 66H; 150/60ZR17 66W; 160/60ZR17 69W; 180/55ZR17 73W; 180/60ZR17 75W; 190/50ZR17 73W; 190/55ZR17 75W; 200/55ZR17 78W; 200/60ZR17 80W"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
