inforced; 140/40B30 57H TL', 36, 'Shinko 777 Tires The Shinko 777 is available in a multitude of sizes to fit many V-Twin and metric cruiser models.', 'The 777 was designed specifically for cruiser model bikes Rubber compound provides more mileage with great wet and dry grip Tread design includes functional siping and grooves for superior traction in wet and dry riding conditions Confidence inspiring traction you can feel when accelerating, braking and cornering Aramid belted provides ample load capacity while also giving more stability Unleash the handling potential of you cruiser motorcycle Tread compound designed for a great combination of traction and mileage Directional tread pattern offers excellent wet and dry traction H rated 4 or 6 ply construction Tubeless Select sizes available with reflective sidewall for nighttime visibility Available in "Reinforced" for heavyweight touring bikes, two-up riding, or when required by OEM specifications Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/shinko777_cruiser_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/shinko777_cruiser_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Cruiser Tire / Harley Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley Sportster / Harley Fxfxr / Harley Street / Harley Touring / Harley V Rod / Harley Softail / Harley Dyna / Harley Dyna Fat Bo / Harley Dyna Street / Harley Dyna Super / Harley Dyna Switch / Harley Softail Del / Harley Softail Deu / Harley Softail Fat / Harley Softail Her / Harley Softail Nig / Harley Sportster 1 / Harley Sportster 8 / Harley Sportster I / Harley Touring Ele / Harley Touring Roa / Harley Touring Str", "Tire Size": "150/90B15 80H Reinforced; 160/80-15 74H; 170/80B15 83H Reinforced; 170/80B15 83H TL Reflective Sidewall; 180/70B15 82H Reinforced; 130/90B16 73H Reinforced; MU85B16 77H Reinforced; 140/90B16 77H Reinforced; 150/80-16 71H Reinforced; 150/80B16 77H Reinforced; 170/70-16 75H; 180/65B16 81H Reinforced; 120/90-17 64H; 130/80-17 65H; 130/80B17 65H TL Reflective Sidewall; 140/80-17 69H; 160/70B17 79H Reinforced; 180/60B17 81V TL; 200/55R17 78V TL; 120/90-18 65H; 130/70B18 69H Reinforced; 140/70B18 72H Reinforced; 150/70B18 76H Reinforced; 160/60R18 70V; 180/55-18 84H; 240/40R18 79V; 100/90-19 61H Reinforced; 110/90-19 62H; 130/60-19 67H; 80/90-21 54H Reinforced; 90/90-21 54H; 120/70-21 68V Reinforced; 130/60-23 75H; 120/50-26 73H Reinforced; 140/40B30 57H TL"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
