d/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_diablo_rosso_iii_front_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_diablo_rosso_iii_front_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_diablo_rosso_iii_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_diablo_rosso_iii_rear_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_tire24045_zr17_rd_rosso_iii.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Hypersport Dot / Sportbike Tire / Multi Compound Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CBR600RR / CBR1000RR, Yamaha YZF-R6 / YZF-R1 / MT-07 / MT-09, Kawasaki Ninja 650 / ZX-6R / ZX-10R, Suzuki GSX-R600 / GSX-R1000, BMW S1000RR, Ducati Monster / Panigale", "Tire Size": "110/70ZR17 54W TL; 120/60ZR17 55W TL; 120/70ZR17 58W TL; 120/70ZR17 58W TL D-Spec; 140/70/R17 66H TL; 150/60ZR17 66W TL; 160/60ZR17 69W TL; 180/55ZR17 73W TL; 180/60ZR17 75W TL; 190/50ZR17 73W TL; 190/55ZR17 75W TL; 200/55ZR17 78W TL; 240/45ZR17 82W TL"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
