ailable in "Reinforced" for heavyweight touring bikes, two-up riding, or when required by OEM specifications Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_tires_tire11090_b19_scorcher31.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_tires_tire11090_b19_scorcher31.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_scorcher31_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Customcruisertouring Bi / Harley Tire / Cruiser Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley Sportster / Harley Fxfxr / Harley Street / Harley Touring / Harley V Rod / Harley Softail / Harley Dyna / Harley Dyna Fat Bo / Harley Dyna Street / Harley Dyna Super / Harley Dyna Switch / Harley Softail Del / Harley Softail Deu / Harley Softail Fat / Harley Softail Her / Harley Softail Nig / Harley Sportster 1 / Harley Sportster 8 / Harley Sportster I / Harley Touring Ele / Harley Touring Roa / Harley Touring Str", "Tire Size": "130/90B16 73H Reinforced; 150/80B16 77H Reinforced; 180/65B16 81H Reinforced; 180/70B16; 130/80B17 65H; 160/70B17 73V; 180/60B17 75V; 130/70B18 63H; 100/90B19 57H; 110/90B19; 130/60B19 61H; 80/90-21 54H Reinforced"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
