eds of touring, cruiser and standard bikes, including current and non-current machines High-mileage, even-wear characteristics, and great grip Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/dunlop_elite4_1800x1800.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/dunlop_elite4_1800x1800.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/dunlop_elite4.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/dunlop_elite4_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Customcruisertouring Bi / Customcruisertouring Ra / Cruiser Tire / Harley Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley Sportster / Harley Fxfxr / Harley Street / Harley Touring / Harley V Rod / Harley Softail / Harley Dyna / Harley Dyna Fat Bo / Harley Dyna Street / Harley Dyna Super / Harley Dyna Switch / Harley Softail Del / Harley Softail Deu / Harley Softail Fat / Harley Softail Her / Harley Softail Nig / Harley Sportster 1 / Harley Sportster 8 / Harley Sportster I / Harley Touring Ele / Harley Touring Roa / Harley Touring Str", "Tire Size": "130/90B16 73H TL; 150/80B16 77H TL; 160/80B16 80H TL; 180/60R16 80H TL; 180/70R16 77H TL; 200/55R16 77H; 150/80R17 72H TL; 110/90B18 61H TL; 130/70B18 63H TL; 130/70R18 63H TL; 250/40R18 81V TL"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
