mpound technology Available in D401T 150/80B16 MT Rear fitment Improves performance and increases tire life Dunlop Part # 45064691 Note: "WWW" indicates Wide White Wall while "NWS" indicates Narrow White Stripe. Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/dunlop_harley_davidson_d401_d401_t_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/dunlop_harley_davidson_d401_d401_t_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "100 On Road 0 Off Road / Whitewall Tire / Customcruisertouring Bi / Customcruisertouring Ra", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley Sportster / Harley Fxfxr / Harley Street / Harley Touring / Harley V Rod / Harley Softail / Harley Dyna / Harley Dyna Fat Bo / Harley Dyna Street / Harley Dyna Super / Harley Dyna Switch / Harley Softail Del / Harley Softail Deu / Harley Softail Fat / Harley Softail Her / Harley Softail Nig / Harley Sportster 1 / Harley Sportster 8 / Harley Sportster I / Harley Touring Ele / Harley Touring Roa / Harley Touring Str", "Tire Size": "130/90B16 73H TL; 150/80B16 71H TL MWW; 150/80B16 71H TL WWW; 150/80B16MT 77H TL \\"T\\"; 160/70B17 73H TL; 160/70B17 73H TL WWW; 200/55R17 78V TL; 90/90-19 52H TL; 100/90-19 57H TL; 100/90-19 57H TL WWW"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
