grip Large rear crown radius provides excellent stability on straight roads, along with light neutral handling and superb line-holding during cornering Linear and neutral handling provided by ultimate grip and smooth turn-in performance Bridgestone exclusive ULTIMATEYE technology improves mileage significantly Easy steering carcass with long distance ride quality Reinforced version features stiffer sidewalls Tubeless Available in "Reinforced" for heavyweight touring bikes, two-up riding, or when required by OEM specifications Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount For The Long Road Ahead Built specifically for the American V-Twin, the Battlecruise H50 provides great handling on both wet and dry surfaces, with excellent mileage and tread wear. Using advanced technology and high quality components, the Battlecruise H50 is a tire built to roam free and confident. Constructed with Confidence Front Tire: Designed with a focus on the vertical stiffness of the tire to ensure ride comfort on long trips Strategic reinforcement on the carcass and envelope Excellent balance between rigidity and shock absorption Improved vibration damping Higher shock absorption Rear Tire: Larger crown profile (CR) Designed to optimize the slip and adhesion portion of rubber on road surfaces Optimized profile and compound delivers extended mileage', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bridgestone_battlecruise_h50_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bridgestone_battlecruise_h50_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bridgestone_h50.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Rear; Front", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Customcruisertouring Bi / Customcruisertouring Ra / Cruiser Tire / Harley Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley Sportster / Harley Fxfxr / Harley 