ge for long trips EasyHandling technology provides improved ground-feel and linear handling characteristics TractionSkin tread surface allow for a quick warm-up and limited break-in period Eligible for Continental''s free 3 year roadside warranty Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/continental_trail_attack3_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/continental_trail_attack3_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Rear; Front", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Dual Road Radial Dot / Dual Road Bias Dot / 90 On Road 10 Off Road / Dual Sport Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "120/70ZR17 58W TL; 120/90-17 64S TL; 130/80-17 65S TT; 130/80R17 65H TL; 140/80R17 69V TL; 150/70R17 69V TL; 160/60R17 69W TL; 170/60R17 72V TL; 170/60R17 72W TL; 180/55R17 73W TL; 190/55R17 75W TL; 140/80-18 70S TT; 150/70R18 70V TL; 150/70ZR18 70W TL; 100/90-19 57H TL; 110/80R19 59V TL; 120/70R19 60V TL; 120/70R19 60W TL; 90/90-21 54V TL"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
