m, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler_tourance_next2.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler_tourance_next2.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Dual Road Bias Dot / 90 On Road 10 Off Road / Dot Tire / Touring Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "130/80R17 65V; 140/80R17 69V; 150/70R17 69V; 170/60R17 72V; 170/60R17 72W; 150/70R18 70V; 150/70ZR18 70W; 100/90-19 57V; 110/80R19 59V; 120/70R19 60V; 120/70R19 60W; 90/90-21 54V"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
