 "Model": "Harley (Sportster, Softail, Dyna, Street Glide, Road King, Fat Boy), Honda Shadow / VTX, Yamaha V-Star / Bolt, Indian Scout / Chief, Kawasaki Vulcan, Suzuki Boulevard", "Tire Size": "140/90-15 70H; 150/90-15 74H; 170/80-15 77H; 130/90-16; 140/90-16 77H; 150/80-16 71H; 160/80-16 75H; 120/90-17 64H; 140/80-17; 110/90-18 61H; 120/90-18 71H; 130/70-18 63H; 100/90-19; 110/90-19 62H; 80/90-21"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
