ps://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_angel_scooter_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_angel_scooter_tires_rear.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Front/Rear; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Scooter Bias / Scooter Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda PCX150 / Ruckus, Yamaha Zuma / XMAX, Vespa Primavera / GTS 300, Suzuki Burgman 400", "Tire Size": "80/100-10; 90/90-10; 100/90-10; 120/90-10; 130/90-10; 3.00-10; 3.50-10; 110/70-11; 120/70-11; 110/70-12; 110/90-12; 120/70-12; 130/70-12; 140/70-12; 110/70-13; 110/90-13; 120/70-13; 130/60-13; 130/70-13; 140/60-13; 140/70-13; 150/70-13; 80/80-14; 90/80-14; 100/80-14; 100/90-14; 110/80-14; 120/70-14; 120/80-14; 140/60-14; 140/70-14; 150/70-14; 120/70-15; 130/80-15; 90/80-16; 100/80-16; 110/70-16; 120/80-16; 130/70-16; 140/70-16"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
