 "Scooter Radial / Scooter Bias / Multi Compound Tire / Scooter Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda PCX150 / Ruckus, Yamaha Zuma / XMAX, Vespa Primavera / GTS 300, Suzuki Burgman 400", "Tire Size": "110/70-12; 120/70-12; 130/70-12; 150/70-13; 120/80-14; 150/70-14; 120/70-15; 120/70R17 58H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
