rcycle-tires-radial-exedra-g853-g852-front.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bodyparts-bridgestone-motorcycle-tires-radial-exedra-g853-g852-front.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bridgestone_exedra_max_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bodyparts-bridgestone-motorcycle-tires-radial-exedra-g853-g852-rear.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Customcruisertouring Bi / Customcruisertouring Ra / Cruiser Tire / Harley Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley (Sportster, Softail, Dyna, Street Glide, Road King, Fat Boy), Honda Shadow / VTX, Yamaha V-Star / Bolt, Indian Scout / Chief, Kawasaki Vulcan, Suzuki Boulevard", "Tire Size": "140/90B15 70H; 150/90B15 74V; 160/80B15 74S; 170/80B15 77H; 180/70B15 76H; 130/90B16 67H; 150/80B16 70H; 150/80B16 71H; 150/80R16 71V; 170/70B16 75H; 180/70R16 77V; 200/60R16 79V; 240/55R16 86V; 120/90B17 64H; 130/70R17 62W; 170/60ZR17 72W; 200/50ZR17 75W; 110/90B18 61H; 120/70R18 59W; 130/70R18 63W; 100/90B19 57H; 110/90B19 62H; 120/70R19 60W; 80/90B21 48H; 90/90B21 54H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
