chines Standard version front is an excellent hard terrain dual sport fitment ADV specific tire Profile with deep and wide knob pattern balancing maximum off-highway traction and predictable on road handling Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_enduro_trail_xt_plus_dakar_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_enduro_trail_xt_plus_dakar_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "20 On Road 80 Off Road / Dot Dirt Tires / Dot Tire / Dirt Bike Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "120/90B17 64T; 130/80B17 65R; 140/80B17 69T; 150/70B17 69T; 170/60B17 72T; 130/80B18 72R; 140/80B18 70T; 150/70B18 70T; 110/80B19 59T; 120/70B19 60T; 80/90B21 48T; 90/90B21 54T; 90/100-21 57H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
