d 20 Off Road / Cruiser Tire / Dual Sport Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley (Sportster, Softail, Dyna, Street Glide, Road King, Fat Boy), Honda Shadow / VTX, Yamaha V-Star / Bolt, Indian Scout / Chief, Kawasaki Vulcan, Suzuki Boulevard", "Tire Size": "130/90-16 73H; 120/90-17 64H; 130/80-17 65H; 110/80-18 58H; 120/80-18 62H; 100/90-19 57H; 90/90-21 54H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
