 "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Dual Onoff Dot / Dirt Bike Tire / 10 On Road 90 Off Road / Dual Sport Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "130/90-17 68R; 120/90-18 65R; 130/90-18 69R; 90/90-21 54R"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
