e and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount OEM Fitments: 120/70ZR18 59W "F" is stock for 2011-Up XL883L and 2008-2013 XR1200X 120/70ZR18 59W "T" is stock for 2014-Up XL1200T', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_tires_tire13060_b21_f_scorcher11_1800x1800.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_tires_tire13060_b21_f_scorcher11_1800x1800.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_scorcher11_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_tires_tire13060_b21_f_scorcher11.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Customcruisertouring Ra / Harley Tire / Cruiser Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley Sportster / Harley Fxfxr / Harley Street / Harley Touring / Harley V Rod / Harley Softail / Harley Dyna / Harley Dyna Fat Bo / Harley Dyna Street / Harley Dyna Super / Harley Dyna Switch / Harley Softail Del / Harley Softail Deu / Harley Softail Fat / Harley Softail Her / Harley Softail Nig / Harley Sportster 1 / Harley Sportster 8 / Harley Sportster I / Harley Touring Ele / Harley Touring Roa / Harley Touring Str", "Tire Size": "140/75R15 65H; 100/80-17 52H; 140/75R17 67V; 150/60ZR17 66W; 150/70ZR17 69W; 180/55ZR17 73W; 200/55R17 78V; 120/70ZR18 59W F; 120/70ZR18 59W T; 160/60R18; 240/40R18 79V; 120/70ZR19 60W; 130/60B21"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
