0_rs_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_mt60_rs_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_mt60_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Dual Road Radial Dot / Dual Road Bias Dot / 70 On Road 30 Off Road / Dual Sport Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "120/70R17 58V; 120/90-17 64S; 120/90-17 64S Enduro; 130/80-17 65H; 140/80-17 66H; 160/60R17 69V; 90/90B19 52P TT; 100/90B19 57H; 90/90-21 54H; 90/90-21 54T TL Enduro"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
