s://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bridgestone_battlax_sc2_scooter_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Scooter Radial / Scooter Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda PCX150 / Ruckus, Yamaha Zuma / XMAX, Vespa Primavera / GTS 300, Suzuki Burgman 400", "Tire Size": "120/70R14 55H; 160/60R14 65H; 160/60R14 65H Rain; 120/70R15 56H; 120/70R15 56H Rain; 160/60R15 67H; 160/60R15 67H Rain"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
