l Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Dual Onoff Dot / 10 On Road 90 Off Road / Dot Dirt Tires / Dual Sport Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "120/90-18; 140/80-18; 90/90-21; 90/100-21"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
