d good water disbursement Improved radial carcass construction for easy handling and high stability 0° steel-belted construction, front and rear, guarantees excellent stability at high speeds Shoulder area is flexible for greater grip Zenith area is wear resistant for increased mileage Continuous transition Tubeless Eligible for Continental''s free 3 year roadside warranty Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/continental_classic_attack_vintage_radial_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/continental_classic_attack_vintage_radial_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Sport Touring Radial Do / Cruiser Tire / Harley Tire / Vintage Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley (Sportster, Softail, Dyna, Street Glide, Road King, Fat Boy), Honda Shadow / VTX, Yamaha V-Star / Bolt, Indian Scout / Chief, Kawasaki Vulcan, Suzuki Boulevard", "Tire Size": "90/90R18 51V; 110/90R18 61V; 120/90R18 65V; 100/90R19 57V; 110/85R19 57V"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
