le off-highway performance Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_enduro_trail_plus_dakar_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_enduro_trail_plus_dakar_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "60 On Road 40 Off Road / Dot Tire / Hard Terrain / Intermediate Terrain", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "150/70B17 69H; 170/60B17 72H; 140/80B18 70H; 150/70B18 70H; 110/80B19 59H; 120/70B19 60H; 90/90B21 54H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
