nda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "110/90-18 62M; 120/90-18 65M; 100/90-19 57M; 110/90-19 65M; 120/90-19 66M; 80/100-21 51M"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
