ed? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler6_days_extreme_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler6_days_extreme_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler6_days_extreme_tires_rear.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Dual Onoff Dot / 10 On Road 90 Off Road / Non Dot Tire / Dot Dirt Tires", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "110/80-18 58R; 120/90-18; 120/90-18 65R TT; 130/90-18 69M TT; 140/80-18 70M TT; 140/80-18 70M TT Extra Soft NON-DOT; 140/80-18 70R Medium; 140/80-18 70R Soft NON-DOT; 140/80-18 70R TT Super Soft NON-DOT; 80/90-21 48R TT; 90/90-21 52M TT; 90/100-21 TT; 90/100-21 TT NON-DOT"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
