t; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Dirt Bike Tire / Non Dot Tire / Hard Terrain / Intermediate Terrain", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "110/100-18 64M; 120/90-18 65M; 110/90-19 62M; 120/80-19 63M; 80/100-21 51M; 90/90-21 54M"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
