ire features dual compound, side strip with high silica content for leaning confidence and the middle stripe balanced with Carbon-Black and Silica for a chemical grip on wet and dry Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here!', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler_roadtec_scooter_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler_roadtec_scooter_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Front/Rear; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Scooter Radial Bias / Scooter Radial / Scooter Bias / Multi Compound Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda PCX150 / Ruckus, Yamaha Zuma / XMAX, Vespa Primavera / GTS 300, Suzuki Burgman 400", "Tire Size": "100/80-10 53L; 120/90-10 66L; 120/70-12 51P; 130/70-12 62P; 110/70-13 48H; 110/90-13 56P; 130/60-13 60P; 150/70-13 64S; 90/90-14 46P; 120/70-14 55S; 120/70R14 55H; 120/80-14 58S; 140/70-14 68P; 150/70-14 66S; 100/80-16 50P; 110/70-16 52S; 120/80-16 60P; 140/70-16 65H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
