excellent stability going through challenging obstacles. Tall blocks provide larger contact patch/flexibility for maximum traction Tube type Hard enduro tire 64M speed rating Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/ircjx8_gekkota_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/ircjx8_gekkota_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Hard Terrain / Intermediate Terrain / Non Dot Tire / Dirt Bike Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "110/100-18; 120/100-18; 140/80-18"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
