bike Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "BMW R1200GS / R1250GS / F850GS, KTM 1290 Super Adventure / 890 Adventure, Honda Africa Twin / CRF300L, Yamaha T\\u00e9n\\u00e9r\\u00e9 700, Triumph Tiger 900 / 1200, Suzuki V-Strom 650, Kawasaki KLR650", "Tire Size": "100/80-17; 110/70-17; 110/80-17; 120/70-17; 120/80-17; 130/70-17; 130/80-17; 140/70-17; 150/70-17; 140/70-18; 150/70-18"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
