 models. Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/Metzeler_Lasertec_Bias_Sport_Touring_Front_Tire.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/Metzeler_Lasertec_Bias_Sport_Touring_Front_Tire.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/metzeler_lasertec_bias_sport_touring_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/Metzeler_Lasertec_Bias_Sport_Touring_Rear_Tire.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Sport Touring Bias Dot / Touring Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Touring", "Tire Size": "100/90-16 54H TL; 110/90V16 59V TL; 120/80VB16 60V TL; 150/80VB16 71V TL; 110/70-17 54H TL; 150/70V17 69V TL; 160/70VB17 73V TL; 90/90-18 51H TL; 100/90V18 56V TL; 110/80-18 58H TL; 110/80-18 58V; 110/80-18 58V TL; 120/80-18 62H TL; 130/70-18 63H TL; 130/80V18 66V TL; 100/90V19 57V TL; 3.25x19 54H TL; 90/90-21 54H TL"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
