 features a reversible tread pattern to prolong tire life and consistency Robust compound promotes the transfer of power to the ground and prevents overheating Replaces the MX32 Pro Blackwall Available in a Stadium variant with an updated compound optimized for Supercross race conditions Tube type (TT) Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_mx32_mid_hard_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/pirelli_mx32_mid_hard_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Rear; Front", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Dirt Bike Tire / Hard Terrain / Intermediate Terrain / Non Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "90/100-16 51M; 70/100-19 42M; 100/90-19 57M; 110/90-19 62M; 110/90-19 Stadium; 120/80-19 63M; 80/100-21 51M; 80/100-21 Stadium; 90/100-21 51M"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
