E", "Product Type": "Dirt Bike Tire / Hard Terrain / Intermediate Terrain / Non Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "90/100-14; 90/100-16; 70/100-17; 100/100-18; 110/100-18; 70/100-19; 100/90-19; 110/90-19; 80/100-21"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
