s/dunlop_k180_af.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/dunlop_k180_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Front/Rear; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Scooter Bias / Off Highway Non Dot Inc / Customcruisertouring Bi / 80 On Road 20 Off Road", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley (Sportster, Softail, Dyna, Street Glide, Road King, Fat Boy), Honda Shadow / VTX, Yamaha V-Star / Bolt, Indian Scout / Chief, Kawasaki Vulcan, Suzuki Boulevard", "Tire Size": "120/90-10 57J TT; 130/90-10 61J TT; 180/80-14 78P TT; 120/90-18 65P TT; 130/80-18 66P TT; 100/90-19 57P TT; 130/80-19 67H TL; 140/80-19 71H TL; 3.00-21 51P; 3.00-21 51P TT"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
