t you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_terra_force_mxsm_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_terra_force_mxsm_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Non Dot Tire / Soft Terrain / Intermediate Terrain / Dual Sport Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "70/100-10 41M TT; 60/100-12 36M TT; 80/100-12 50M TT; 70/100-14 40M TT; 90/100-14 49M TT; 90/100-16 51M TT; 70/100-17 40M TT; 70/100-19 42M TT; 100/90-19 57M TT; 110/90-19 62M TT; 120/80-19 63M TT; 80/100-21 51M TT; 90/90-21 54M TT"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
