p", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/bridgestone_tw152_e_bolt_sk_unotfoundin_tr.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Dual Road Radial Dot / 80 On Road 20 Off Road / Dual Sport Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley (Sportster, Softail, Dyna, Street Glide, Road King, Fat Boy), Honda Shadow / VTX, Yamaha V-Star / Bolt, Indian Scout / Chief, Kawasaki Vulcan, Suzuki Boulevard", "Tire Size": "130/80R17 65H TT; 140/80R17 69H TT SCR950; 150/70R17 69H TL R1150GS; 150/70R17 69V TL; 100/90-19 Type A; 110/80R19 Type E"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
