’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_pilot_road5_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_pilot_road5_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_tires_tire_rd469_w_cg_compound.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_pilot_road4_tires.webp", "https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/michelin_pilot_road4_rear_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Touring Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "BMW R1200GS / R1250GS / F850GS, KTM 1290 Super Adventure / 890 Adventure, Honda Africa Twin / CRF300L, Yamaha T\\u00e9n\\u00e9r\\u00e9 700, Triumph Tiger 900 / 1200, Suzuki V-Strom 650, Kawasaki KLR650", "Tire Size": "120/60ZR17 55W; 120/70ZR17 58W; 150/70ZR17 69W; 160/60ZR17 69W; 180/55ZR17 73W; 190/50ZR17 73W; 190/55ZR17 75W"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
