lin_star_cross_mini_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Rear; Front; Front/Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Off Highway Non Dot Inc / Dirt Bike Tire / Hard Terrain / Intermediate Terrain", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "2.50-10 TT; 2.75-10 TT; 80/100-12 TT; 2.50-12 TT; 60/100-14 TT"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
