://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_terra_force_exmh_super_light_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "20 On Road 80 Off Road / 10 On Road 90 Off Road / Dot Dirt Tires / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "100/100-18 59M TT; 110/100-18 64M TT; 120/90-18 65R TT; 120/100-18 68M TT; 90/100-21 57M TT"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
