ed? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_touring_force_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/mitas_touring_force_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "100 On Road 0 Off Road / Touring Tire / Multi Compound Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Touring", "Tire Size": "120/60ZR17 55W; 120/70ZR17 58W; 150/70R17 69V; 160/60ZR17 69W; 170/60ZR17 72W; 180/55ZR17 73W; 190/50ZR17 73W; 190/55ZR17 73W; 110/80R19 59V; 120/70ZR19 60W"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
