 Off Road / 30 On Road 70 Off Road / Dot Dirt Tires / Dirt Bike Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "5.10x17 71P; 4.10x18; 4.10x18 58P; 4.10x18 63M; 4.50x18 70M; 4.60x18; 4.60x18 70M; 5.10x18 74M; 100/90-19 57M; 110/90-19 68M; 3.00x21 51M; 3.00x21 57M"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
