rrain / Intermediate Terrain / Soft Terrain", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "80/100-12 41M; 60/100-14 30M; 90/100-14 49M; 90/100-16 52M; 70/100-17 40M; 100/100-18 59M; 110/100-18 64M; 70/100-19 42M; 100/90-19 57M; 110/90-19 62M; 80/100-21 51M"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
