roduct Type": "Customcruisertouring Ra / Cruiser Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Harley-Davidson", "Model": "Harley (Sportster, Softail, Dyna, Street Glide, Road King, Fat Boy), Honda Shadow / VTX, Yamaha V-Star / Bolt, Indian Scout / Chief, Kawasaki Vulcan, Suzuki Boulevard", "Tire Size": "130/70HR18 63H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
