0GS, KTM 1290 Super Adventure / 890 Adventure, Honda Africa Twin / CRF300L, Yamaha T\\u00e9n\\u00e9r\\u00e9 700, Triumph Tiger 900 / 1200, Suzuki V-Strom 650, Kawasaki KLR650", "Tire Size": "nan"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
