V", "Product Type": "Mud Tire / Soft Terrain / Utv Atv Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "nan"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
