 Road / Intermediate Terrain / Dot Tire / Dual Sport Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "90/90-21 (M/C) 54R TT; 90/100-21 (M/C) 57R TT"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
