ttack. This is possible due to the revolutionary raw tread surface, which is the result of a new mold coating technology which eliminates the need for tire-release agents 120/70-17 and 160/60-17 are OEM for KTM SMC 2007-2011 Eligible for Continental''s free 3 year roadside warranty Notes : It is recommended to change your valve stem, tube and/or rim strip when installing a new tire. Shop Here! Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/continental_conti_attack_sm_supermoto_evo_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/continental_conti_attack_sm_supermoto_evo_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Rear; Front", "Type": "STREET BIKE", "Product Type": "Hypersport Dot / Supermoto Tire / Multi Compound Tire / Dot Tire", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CBR600RR / CBR1000RR, Yamaha YZF-R6 / YZF-R1 / MT-07 / MT-09, Kawasaki Ninja 650 / ZX-6R / ZX-10R, Suzuki GSX-R600 / GSX-R1000, BMW S1000RR, Ducati Monster / Panigale", "Tire Size": "110/70R17 54H; 120/70R17 58H; 140/70R17 66H; 150/60R17 66H; 160/60R17 69H"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
