bs on the front deliver extreme braking traction and control into corners Tube type (TT) Need your tire mounted? We’ve got you covered! Tire Mount Discount', 'nan', 'nan', 'https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/cst_legion_mxvi_soft_terrain_tires.webp', '["https://americaapi.kaafifoods.com/storage/products/cst_legion_mxvi_soft_terrain_tires.webp"]', '{"Wheel Location": "Front; Rear", "Type": "DIRT BIKE", "Product Type": "Dirt Bike Tire / Non Dot Tire / Soft Terrain", "Make": "Honda", "Model": "Honda CRF250R / CRF450R, Yamaha YZ250F / YZ450F, KTM 250 SX-F / 450 SX-F, Kawasaki KX250 / KX450, Suzuki RM-Z250 / RM-Z450, Husqvarna FC 250 / FC 450", "Tire Size": "80/100-12 47M; 90/100-14 49M; 90/100-16 50M; 70/100-19 42M"}', 50, 1, 1, NOW(), NOW());
